            <div xml:id="m-5e462956-e8c0-4240-846e-c13bb01219b4">
              <lg xml:id="m-7eb1b712-83b2-4d84-b396-158af76570d4">
                <l xml:id="m-bfec5233-bb96-41dc-84fe-afdc56675829" facs="#m-759d8086-9cd8-49cd-bacc-2c190b48b351" label="ambiguous">Wednesday in Holy Week</l><l xml:id="m-862cb07a-f833-41d0-ad01-cbd7bc6d3af4" facs="#m-8e23e8c2-be6f-43cf-9e9a-59eaf3abc0cb" label="ambiguous">eis</l><l xml:id="m-76b966ca-336a-4037-9faa-e5beb8f3bfd0" facs="#m-8278bb8a-6a4b-489a-b1a6-00c7f03f413e" label="lyrics-like">intravérunt áquae usque ad á¬ ni¬</l><l xml:id="m-7a0ce5ea-5819-448f-8fc6-e6f993537531" facs="#m-4913c455-aa34-4d3e-9c0d-c5677ec821b6" label="lyrics-like">mam mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-e226a9cc-3fae-41b2-ac2a-41fffe73a969" facs="#m-1d8521fe-5c5c-4d8d-8cca-1bd5e04f4f3e" label="lyrics-like">am: in-fí- xus sum in li-mo</l><l xml:id="m-ba1ab10b-9e48-4da3-8026-86db3fc776a7" facs="#m-9f85adbc-28aa-4543-872d-eda05b0cb55d" label="ambiguous">pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-4186febf-9566-4d47-91d0-81fe922aef3a" facs="#m-642fd081-65fa-41c4-a53a-62f73b2a3a0e" label="lyrics-like">fún¬ di,</l><l xml:id="m-064a3db4-d0a0-4745-beb1-f91a57c7f66e" facs="#m-d13df91e-54bf-42d0-b579-b781aea73f97" label="lyrics-like">"substánti-a.</l><l xml:id="m-042f9be0-9a41-42bb-98d6-d919a9cc56d1" facs="#m-362b654d-97b4-4a89-892c-ce24b929b5c0" label="ambiguous">et non est</l><l xml:id="m-7e6be046-0013-49e2-9acb-e42be9b1c830" facs="#m-bac40c29-5e06-4720-abcf-740d05e7d6eb" label="lyrics-like">Then The V. Dóminus vobiscum is said, without Flectámus génua.</l><l xml:id="m-43a55583-e751-42de-b66f-58241d20aff2" facs="#m-d08c92a8-8d32-4898-a76d-0231945903a1" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-adc53933-79f4-4fea-9a98-8f2154a2de05" facs="#m-748041c0-f26b-41c3-be0e-e7ed1ea52234" label="ambiguous">Collect</l><l xml:id="m-5bb4fe56-46d2-428f-a8f8-f1a4eb80e1b4" facs="#m-99967285-bb76-460e-9059-45f7656198d6" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui pro nobis Filium nobis fámulis tuis: ut resurre¬</l><l xml:id="m-8004f750-d070-47b4-bf49-350ac35e9001" facs="#m-804ac78f-0274-478d-948c-ce2599080fb2" label="ambiguous">I tuum crucis patibulum subire</l><l xml:id="m-a74bd7ca-9716-461f-a7b0-a9e2cba7a712" facs="#m-db962765-8d8b-4580-9b4c-1d9c0d658e86" label="lyrics-like">ctiónis grátiam consequámur.</l><l xml:id="m-0c35ad55-39ab-47a3-9d99-2b3429468675" facs="#m-d9b70366-6bde-4eb3-a032-a2597f28e65d" label="lyrics-like">voluísti, ut inimici a nobis ex¬</l><l xml:id="m-9bc2c2d5-13db-4e5e-8551-3984c9b0b584" facs="#m-3e4470ca-448e-45b5-a249-f760e498284b" label="lyrics-like">Per eúmdem Dóminum nostrum</l><l xml:id="m-c007cf81-ac04-4192-926c-2f91645d3182" facs="#m-ddaa7746-68dc-49b4-aa32-f24fdd64025c" label="lyrics-like">pélleres potestâtem: concéde Jesum Christum.</l><l xml:id="m-7fc0cece-08ef-4575-8992-04ec4e574494" facs="#m-287cea86-7398-4e5a-8d92-aafd5b010bb9" label="text-like">This collect only is said.</l><l xml:id="m-96f1ca63-b3a9-41ef-a312-013bd8183481" facs="#m-e4b1dbb9-0073-4d14-9c08-e51b155f0e66" label="ambiguous">Lectio Isaiae Prophetae. 53, 1-12</l><l xml:id="m-0707f941-8c40-40c8-a8be-1171f4db0b2f" facs="#m-cb34d37e-5dfb-4d78-94af-7153a07b5b21" label="lyrics-like">N diébus illis : Dixit Isaías: quisque in viam suam decliná¬</l><l xml:id="m-e97f9862-c44e-4df3-9050-5ff772ae4e31" facs="#m-c8274c02-cbf1-4b4f-9dbc-633b15fa8b9f" label="lyrics-like">1 Dómine, quis crédidit auditui</l><l xml:id="m-d36e48fa-b8a8-4a5a-87d8-9c03951f76c9" facs="#m-09d94697-34df-46a3-acd9-16728d94014f" label="lyrics-like">vit : et pósuit Dóminus in co</l><l xml:id="m-242e32dd-f403-4e65-8bb5-fe7ac08e11e0" facs="#m-fb45573c-5d41-42df-8822-e8da562a3ec2" label="lyrics-like">nostro? et bráchium Dómini cui</l><l xml:id="m-af8ba34e-7be1-4ab5-aaf1-4eaf46c55ac6" facs="#m-bb8e1878-3d5e-49e3-bcf9-e637565c25c6" label="lyrics-like">iniquitátem ómnium nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-a9ef2835-e9b1-43a6-ac67-b3554dc9baf0" facs="#m-a47569cf-8ae3-4a4a-afaf-f236d0d014f2" label="lyrics-like">revelátum est? Et ascéndet sicut</l><l xml:id="m-01cdc9a1-665b-4f91-9c20-ba9863eec5e8" facs="#m-3ca9668b-1583-4f60-ae85-6ef2f4f14e48" label="lyrics-like">Oblátus est, quia ipse vóluit. et</l><l xml:id="m-074f4837-ac8e-4e50-9a90-9af5764220d1" facs="#m-e2765bda-daa0-447d-ab41-33afd1399b67" label="lyrics-like">virgúltum coram eo, et sicut</l><l xml:id="m-602f2eba-9e2e-4bad-8fba-647d0d8a4953" facs="#m-3919b3ac-ed0d-4c4b-9dca-3696182a57a6" label="lyrics-like">non apéruit os suum: sicut</l><l xml:id="m-60a5f655-028a-4f9a-b398-7be36174b96d" facs="#m-bf3303d4-c269-48a2-898c-c3bb925913a8" label="lyrics-like">radix de terra sitiénti : non est</l><l xml:id="m-1aab97de-e0fc-4e82-8331-5deee0423841" facs="#m-a487b9b1-09b7-42c7-be3c-d22a9d539427" label="lyrics-like">ovis ad occisiónem ducétur, et</l><l xml:id="m-61be5d96-8639-4a3d-8441-19441b74ba92" facs="#m-8711c684-6b1a-4414-8087-ef7325a43ac9" label="lyrics-like">spécies ei, neque decor: et</l><l xml:id="m-6b5ea3fe-87d7-4612-b005-70ea5bd3636c" facs="#m-9176ea65-cb64-4d76-8433-c4e477902ef7" label="lyrics-like">quasi agnus coram tondénte se</l><l xml:id="m-bc37bce9-333b-481f-aa33-f819e055b93f" facs="#m-3319d0b8-ab39-4c8f-bee4-9ee161d4f48b" label="lyrics-like">vidimus eum, et non erat aspé¬</l><l xml:id="m-4e37455c-6998-4320-a081-ffc89fb5ad6e" facs="#m-41ffcd96-6e17-4d29-be72-2b0550229154" label="lyrics-like">obmutéscet, et non apériet os</l><l xml:id="m-a9d4b626-c90c-412d-a514-aab09e0a4038" facs="#m-0ee61cd5-7a3d-4291-91e9-53468c11e691" label="lyrics-like">ctus, et desiderávimus eum</l><l xml:id="m-4c22f576-2a3f-4a9d-98fc-2edbdff3afb6" facs="#m-e95022f4-6ca1-42d6-9cf9-24776c98b575" label="lyrics-like">suum. De angústia, et de judicio</l><l xml:id="m-9d7ebed5-f881-4e29-9ab9-06679c1f476e" facs="#m-f2a7df31-ea70-4621-b66a-35d4d43f024a" label="lyrics-like">despéctum, et novíssimum viró¬</l><l xml:id="m-7b6ce83d-acd6-4500-a6fb-b5aae95bdf90" facs="#m-3c20abb8-b0d0-41ca-b305-1736f0213294" label="lyrics-like">sublátus est : generatiónem ejus</l><l xml:id="m-0eb233ee-b929-4fe5-bbb6-e6a7183e8de3" facs="#m-4373e2af-63b0-4d71-b69b-f1618f9e0991" label="lyrics-like">rum, virum dolórum, et sciéntem</l><l xml:id="m-ff33f58e-de2c-4a51-9548-5bddbca2ab35" facs="#m-b41940e1-7ce2-4bf1-84e7-61cc2a912058" label="lyrics-like">quis enarrábit? quia abscíssus</l><l xml:id="m-52e1e092-6520-4c2e-9e2f-bd3af9bd3a89" facs="#m-948240ff-444c-4206-bac1-209b85eb216b" label="lyrics-like">infirmitátem: et quasi abscón¬</l><l xml:id="m-2ef1ffb5-554e-489d-8725-ab750de81fcd" facs="#m-f92efb3c-fc71-4cef-b7c8-772ca50af689" label="lyrics-like">est de terra vivéntium : propter</l><l xml:id="m-928e531c-32aa-4b97-a5f4-2d62c149179c" facs="#m-6733ce15-ace3-44af-9460-c565c13eaf4c" label="lyrics-like">ditus vultus ejus, et despéctus,</l><l xml:id="m-6586bc90-a0fc-4979-899e-7a9d36421c35" facs="#m-3f884c0f-c75c-4331-9b04-bea84824d91e" label="lyrics-like">scelus pópuli mei percússi eum.</l><l xml:id="m-db823c1c-c311-4835-84b4-d36310524b7e" facs="#m-86feea17-0053-470a-b44b-55cfbf8338b8" label="lyrics-like">unde nec reputávimus eum. Vere</l><l xml:id="m-5eb1c2a1-11aa-421e-85f7-afc27dfb0ade" facs="#m-646e870f-e615-401d-9477-fc9cbf0a9723" label="lyrics-like">Et dabit impios pro sepultúra,</l><l xml:id="m-623d9bbb-4ed5-4701-8277-1320ebd5722f" facs="#m-e5ec7c7d-63ce-4663-91fd-0eb308ccc93f" label="lyrics-like">languóres nostros ipse tulit, et</l><l xml:id="m-8d8ba4e2-b13a-4b53-a65c-fa1ab882a56c" facs="#m-b858d690-7f9a-466b-ace5-f531a159470c" label="lyrics-like">et dívitem pro morte sua: eo</l><l xml:id="m-9ef55f95-0d0c-474d-acfa-2a5b9d20cee1" facs="#m-900bf7e6-ba39-47cc-8bed-d514e387eaef" label="lyrics-like">quod iniquitátem non fécerit,</l><l xml:id="m-dd099e0d-c5c2-44a5-a100-6c64b2227381" facs="#m-a3d1cf31-f311-4867-8876-fd0237d604c9" label="lyrics-like">dolóres nostros ipse portávit:</l><l xml:id="m-6958410b-8240-4772-be66-76dee6b26551" facs="#m-5836a893-5234-432e-ab37-b9e38fd16e9b" label="lyrics-like">et nos putávimus eum quasi</l><l xml:id="m-828b848d-14a0-440c-8a32-2992aef2265f" facs="#m-a98e442f-727c-4545-bba0-a40c39010ba6" label="ambiguous">neque dolus fuerit in ore ejus.</l><l xml:id="m-455b80f3-e16a-404d-bfdf-62c3c4834228" facs="#m-867adc10-bca9-4cf9-9beb-817670e1636e" label="lyrics-like">leprósum, et percússum a Deo,</l><l xml:id="m-b211dd95-7f86-4f26-aefe-eebb4a010f84" facs="#m-728e8c55-8d8f-458c-a937-95938e49ef37" label="lyrics-like">Et Dóminus vóluit contérere eum</l><l xml:id="m-5ec49810-f747-4204-a97b-732584876790" facs="#m-b392fcc8-88af-4af0-9d45-c0c5435fd8ee" label="lyrics-like">et humiliátum. Ipse autem vul¬</l><l xml:id="m-ce920bbb-d23d-4318-a19c-52797cc187e4" facs="#m-ac41ecb8-43d0-4e3d-a1db-a0a94552b9b7" label="lyrics-like">in infirmitáte: si posúerit pro</l><l xml:id="m-963b755f-0984-48c6-bea9-513b3c1d18fa" facs="#m-e2ea5417-153b-4b77-a0f6-27f45d71830f" label="lyrics-like">nerátus est propter iniquitátes</l><l xml:id="m-88a0d654-058f-4af5-9d64-ed723eb136b3" facs="#m-de0f0e62-a5e5-4c5e-9fab-a6eb89468110" label="lyrics-like">peccáto ánimam suam, vidébit</l><l xml:id="m-084456ff-a7d2-470a-9e54-433f912a78e5" facs="#m-2fe73ad4-4099-4df4-9581-83f0e1922f0b" label="lyrics-like">nostras, attritus est propter scé¬</l><l xml:id="m-34cd7adf-5d23-4bdc-ae31-836186adee1a" facs="#m-aff9e51b-3a84-44e5-94b7-f953f2548d20" label="lyrics-like">semen longaévum, et volúntas</l><l xml:id="m-4a65a6d1-91cd-4b10-a815-b8491061c7ca" facs="#m-0dce8fa3-72ff-4201-be0c-8385033050f5" label="ambiguous">lera nostra: disciplina pacis</l><l xml:id="m-7a68553d-91b3-488d-891e-daad4437cfd1" facs="#m-d419ef27-2858-4b2d-ab22-62e7d97f17a8" label="lyrics-like">Dómini in manu ejus dirigétur.</l><l xml:id="m-251c4b25-4b3c-49a3-b2f3-6f7d563b2597" facs="#m-213938a3-0828-4209-ac02-f434351bdae8" label="lyrics-like">Pro eo quod laborávit ánima</l><l xml:id="m-610b1769-bd39-4742-bd34-3251b684bb4c" facs="#m-6358e55b-0680-4803-87f1-9c8da0bbd02b" label="lyrics-like">nostrae super eum, et livóre</l><l xml:id="m-b82aea70-233a-46e4-b8a1-d944a77da754" facs="#m-9e045ff4-cd1a-4076-8a5f-2262d8c555aa" label="lyrics-like">ejus sanáti sumus. Omnes nos</l><l xml:id="m-bf523bc3-2f3a-4fe6-b806-e3534857a419" facs="#m-70d2ff16-e6ce-43f6-9748-a0c6b29011f2" label="lyrics-like">ejus, vidébit, et saturábitur : in</l><l xml:id="m-00d06cab-4007-421e-b6fa-76c30178336f" facs="#m-08cbd1c3-96ab-41e1-8cc3-2f78825185a1" label="lyrics-like">quasi oves errávimus, unus- sciéntia sua justificábit ipse ju¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>